1
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:12,100
Cereal killer.
玉米片殺人狂 （音同連續殺人狂）

2
00:00:12,770 --> 00:00:14,110
Cereal killer?
玉米片殺人狂？

3
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:16,640
Hey,come on,I say more dumb things before 9 a.m...
我一早說的蠢話 

4
00:00:16,810 --> 00:00:19,250
...than most people say all day.
比別人整天說的還多

5
00:00:21,050 --> 00:00:22,040
What?
怎麼了？

6
00:00:22,250 --> 00:00:26,240
I can't find anything that I wanna eat. Everything makes me nauseous.
我不知道要吃什麼 吃什麼都會噁心

7
00:00:26,490 --> 00:00:29,320
I'm telling you,being pregnant is no piece of cake. Oh,cake!
懷孕有夠難搞的…啊，蛋糕

8
00:00:30,890 --> 00:00:31,880
No.
不行

9
00:00:33,330 --> 00:00:35,190
Honey,I'm sorry.
真可憐

10
00:00:36,360 --> 00:00:40,200
What is that smell? It's coming from the bathroom.
什麼香味？是浴室傳出來的

11
00:00:40,800 --> 00:00:43,790
Pregnancy does give you some weird cravings.
你倒是多了些怪癖

12
00:00:44,810 --> 00:00:49,210
It's me. It's Phoebe. Listen,there's something in here I want to eat.
是我，菲比 這裡有我想吃的東西

14
00:00:50,650 --> 00:00:52,640
What smells so good?
什麼味道這麼香？

15
00:00:53,580 --> 00:00:56,880
-ls it the shampoo? It's guava. -No.
是新洗髮精嗎？番石榴香味 不是

17
00:00:57,950 --> 00:00:59,390
Wait.
等一下

18
00:01:00,620 --> 00:01:02,720
Is it my bologna sandwich?
是我的紅腸三明治嗎？

19
00:01:04,990 --> 00:01:06,720
Yes. Yes. Yes.
對，沒錯

20
00:01:06,960 --> 00:01:11,160
I can't believe it. The baby wants bologna. The baby wants meat. I can't eat meat.
寶寶居然想吃紅腸 寶寶想吃肉，我不能吃肉

21
00:01:11,470 --> 00:01:12,730
Wait!
等一下

22
00:01:14,070 --> 00:01:15,590
Maybe it's the pickle!
也許是醃黃瓜

23
00:01:16,600 --> 00:01:18,570
The One With the Fake Party
本集播出：「求愛十八招」

00:01:19,600 --> 00:01:20,570
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

24
00:02:01,654 --> 00:02:03,986
（中央咖啡館）

25
00:02:06,350 --> 00:02:07,450
What are you writing?
你在寫什麼？

26
00:02:07,720 --> 00:02:11,950
Joshua's coming in tomorrow,and since I don't have the guts to ask him out...
約書亞明天要來 既然我沒膽約他

27
00:02:12,160 --> 00:02:15,650
...I'm gonna sell him a coat and put this note in the pocket.
我決定賣他一件外套 再把紙條塞進口袋

29
00:02:16,630 --> 00:02:20,620
"Joshua,give me a call sometime. Guys like you...
「約書亞：有空打電話給我」 「你這樣的人…」

30
00:02:20,900 --> 00:02:23,100
...never go out of style."
「…永不退流行」

31
00:02:24,240 --> 00:02:26,230
What did you throw away?
你扔了哪些人？

32
00:02:28,510 --> 00:02:31,340
-Hi,guys. -What have you guys been up to?
你們做了什麼？

33
00:02:31,650 --> 00:02:35,810
We went to see a collection of Victorian doorknobs at the museum.
我們去看維多利亞時期門把展

35
00:02:36,080 --> 00:02:37,480
Without me?
沒找我去？

36
00:02:39,220 --> 00:02:42,820
My uncle dragged us there, but it turned out to be really interesting.
是舅舅拖我們去的 結果很有意思

37
00:02:43,090 --> 00:02:46,030
They were so ornate and beautiful. Look at that.
那些門把很華麗，你們看

38
00:02:46,230 --> 00:02:50,690
I don't know how museums work in England, but here,you're not supposed to take stuff.
我不知道英國的國情 但這裡不能順手牽羊

39
00:02:51,600 --> 00:02:53,430
I got it from the gift shop.
這是禮品部的

40
00:02:53,670 --> 00:02:55,570
They have really lax security there.
那裡沒什麼防盜措施

41
00:02:57,240 --> 00:02:58,710
It's a joke.
這是笑話

42
00:03:00,340 --> 00:03:02,470
Anyone for more tea?
（英國腔）誰還要喝茶？

43
00:03:03,750 --> 00:03:06,010
No,just me then.
（英國腔）那我自己叫了

44
00:03:06,850 --> 00:03:08,980
Hey,Ringo.
鸚鵡先生

45
00:03:09,480 --> 00:03:13,280
Every time Emily's around,you talk like her. Would you please cut it out?
每次艾蜜莉在，你就怪腔怪調 別鬧了

46
00:03:13,450 --> 00:03:16,480
I think you like it.
我看你喜歡喔

47
00:03:17,090 --> 00:03:19,490
I think you can't resist me when I do it.
你無法抗拒這樣的我

48
00:03:19,660 --> 00:03:23,190
You want to eat me up like a cream "pumpy."
你想一口…了我

49
00:03:24,770 --> 00:03:28,960
-What? -All right,look,I don't know all the words.
什麼？ 我不是每個英國字都會

50
00:03:32,710 --> 00:03:35,300
Right. I've got to be off. I'll see you. Bye-bye,then.
我該走了，再見咯

51
00:03:35,480 --> 00:03:37,380
Bye-bye,then.
再見咯

52
00:03:39,710 --> 00:03:41,650
You guys seem to be having a good time.
你們相處得很愉快

53
00:03:41,820 --> 00:03:45,910
She is amazing, and she's so much fun.
對，她人很棒，而且很有趣

54
00:03:46,190 --> 00:03:49,850
And you know what? When I'm with her,I'm fun!
跟她在一起時，我也很有趣

55
00:03:51,760 --> 00:03:55,220
I do things like run off to Vermont...
我會跑去佛蒙特 
56
00:03:55,400 --> 00:03:58,230
...and you guys saw the doorknob.
你們也看到那個門把了


57
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:02,360
I even signed up for helicopter classes.
我甚至報名學開直升機

58
00:04:03,770 --> 00:04:06,710
She's leaving in two days. I don't have to do it.
她過兩天就走了，我不必真學

59
00:04:07,140 --> 00:04:09,230
Two days? You must be bummed.
兩天？你一定很失望

60
00:04:09,440 --> 00:04:13,540
She's got to go back to London,but I've been prepared for this from the start.
她非回去不可 不過我早就有心理準備 
 
62
00:04:13,820 --> 00:04:17,480
We both knew we had two weeks together, and then that's it.
我們都知道我們只有這2星期

63
00:04:17,720 --> 00:04:20,380
Hey,that's what all my relationships are like.
我的每段戀情都是

64
00:04:21,160 --> 00:04:24,390
Yes,but in Ross' case, they both know in two weeks that's it.
羅斯他們是「雙方」都知道 只有2星期

65
00:04:26,390 --> 00:04:29,020
-Pheebs! -Hello. Hello.
菲比

66
00:04:29,230 --> 00:04:31,220
No,I know. Yeah.
寶寶好啊 好啦

67
00:04:33,170 --> 00:04:35,570
So the baby is totally craving meat.
寶寶想肉想瘋了

68
00:04:35,800 --> 00:04:40,400
I tried tricking it,and I made it a soy burger, so that maybe it'd think it was getting meat.
下午我想用素肉堡騙他 讓他以為他吃到肉

69
00:04:40,680 --> 00:04:42,510
And I got nauseous.
結果就反胃了

70
00:04:42,880 --> 00:04:45,970
Maybe that's because soy burgers suck.
也許是因為素肉堡粉難吃

71
00:04:47,350 --> 00:04:49,650
But I'm no obstetrician....
不過應該很營養

72
00:04:50,750 --> 00:04:52,780
Being pregnant is hard on your tummy.
懷孕真難吃東西

73
00:04:53,090 --> 00:04:55,990
At least you got that cool,pregnant-lady glow.
但你有一種孕婦的光彩

74
00:04:56,160 --> 00:04:59,290
That's sweat. You throw up all morning, you'll have that glow too.
你要是吐一早上也會有光彩

75
00:05:07,740 --> 00:05:08,720
Okay.

76
00:05:08,900 --> 00:05:12,130
-Here's that trench coat that you wanted. -Great.
這是你要的風衣 太好了

77
00:05:14,110 --> 00:05:15,670
It's comfortable.
很舒服

78
00:05:15,940 --> 00:05:18,810
You could really flash somebody in this.
這可以用來裝變態

79
00:05:19,610 --> 00:05:24,350
No. They don't want you to put your hands in the pockets until you are out of the store.
不行，出了店門 才能把手放進口袋裡

80
00:05:25,450 --> 00:05:26,610
Why not?
為什麼？

81
00:05:26,790 --> 00:05:28,420
Well,because...
因為…

82
00:05:28,720 --> 00:05:30,990
...we get a lot of
有很多人…

83
00:05:33,390 --> 00:05:35,020
They ruin it for everybody.
真是害群之馬 

84
00:05:35,230 --> 00:05:36,490
I know.
是啊

85
00:05:36,760 --> 00:05:39,230
I wore that sweater on a date last night.
我昨晚穿那件 喀什米爾毛衣去約會

86
00:05:40,870 --> 00:05:43,360
It was the first date since the divorce.
我離婚後第一次約會

87
00:05:44,140 --> 00:05:47,270
Congratulations. So do you love her?
恭喜，你愛她嗎？

88
00:05:48,240 --> 00:05:51,040
She's nice, but it made me realize...
她還不錯，不過我也發現 

89
00:05:51,280 --> 00:05:54,110
...I'm just not ready to be dating.
我還沒有心情約會

90
00:05:59,220 --> 00:06:01,750
That's interesting.
真有意思

91
00:06:03,020 --> 00:06:06,020
-What was that? -Just an anti-theft device.
那是什麼？ 只是防盜磁條

92
00:06:06,890 --> 00:06:08,360
Then what's this?
那這是什麼？

93
00:06:08,630 --> 00:06:12,690
You need that too,because a thief could just tear this up.
那個也要，因為這個一撕就碎

94
00:06:18,140 --> 00:06:22,910
We have to have a party in five minutes, so everybody cancel your plans.
晚上有派對 其實是5分鐘後，有事快取消

95
00:06:24,050 --> 00:06:25,310
What's going on?
你在說什麼？ 怎麼回事？

96
00:06:25,550 --> 00:06:28,540
We have to have a bon-voyage party for Emily.
我們要幫艾蜜莉辦驚喜歡送會

97
00:06:28,780 --> 00:06:30,380
But it's actually for Joshua.
其實是為了約書亞

98
00:06:30,790 --> 00:06:35,150
That sucks. Nobody's ever thrown me a bon-voyage-Emily party.
討厭 都沒人幫我辦過假歡送會

99
00:06:35,990 --> 00:06:38,320
He said he's not ready to date.
他說他還沒有心情約會

100
00:06:38,560 --> 00:06:41,790
So I had to invite him to a party if I wanted to see him outside of work.
我得找他參加派對 才能在工作之外見到他

101
00:06:41,960 --> 00:06:46,660
And now I have created the perfect opportunity to seduce him.
現在我製造了一個 色誘他的完美機會

102
00:06:47,340 --> 00:06:50,700
As much as I'd like to meet Josh and warn him...
我很想當面警告約書亞

103
00:06:52,670 --> 00:06:56,670
...Emily and I won't be here. She's gonna come by to say goodbye...
但艾蜜莉和我不能參加 她會來說聲再見

104
00:06:56,880 --> 00:07:01,010
...and then I've got a special evening planned. Sorry. No party.
然後我安排了整晚的節目 對不起，沒戲唱了

105
00:07:03,850 --> 00:07:06,480
-Hello? -Surprise!
驚喜！

106
00:07:08,020 --> 00:07:09,790
Surprise!
驚喜！

107
00:07:11,460 --> 00:07:14,090
No one's thrown me a surprise party before.
沒有人替我辦過驚喜派對

108
00:07:14,300 --> 00:07:17,090
Well,it was all Ross' idea.
這都是羅斯的主意

109
00:07:18,770 --> 00:07:21,100
You're so sweet.
你真好

110
00:07:21,370 --> 00:07:23,300
And I'm so surprised.
我好驚喜喔

111
00:07:27,610 --> 00:07:28,940
You didn't know?
你真的沒料到？

112
00:07:39,320 --> 00:07:42,150
Why are you over here if Joshua's over there?
約書亞在那邊，你怎麼在這邊

113
00:07:42,420 --> 00:07:44,980
I'm trying to play hard-to-get.
我想假裝很難上手

114
00:07:46,360 --> 00:07:48,160
Quick! He's looking. Say something funny.
快，說句好笑的話

115
00:07:49,260 --> 00:07:50,490
Like what?
舉個例？

116
00:07:52,970 --> 00:07:54,530
What's so funny?
什麼事這麼好笑？

117
00:07:56,500 --> 00:07:57,630
I said,"Like what?"
我說「舉個例」

118
00:07:59,610 --> 00:08:01,130
Now that's a thinker.
真深奧

119
00:08:02,540 --> 00:08:05,310
This playing-hard-to-get thing is not working.
假裝很難上手沒用

120
00:08:05,580 --> 00:08:07,740
Hand me those cherries.
把櫻桃給我，好…

121
00:08:15,990 --> 00:08:18,290
-Care for a cherry? -No,thanks.
要吃櫻桃嗎？ 不要，謝謝

122
00:08:18,560 --> 00:08:22,620
I can tie one of these into a knot using just my tongue.
我可以用舌頭把櫻桃梗打結

123
00:08:36,040 --> 00:08:37,240
You okay?
你還好嗎？

124
00:08:37,880 --> 00:08:39,710
You all right?
沒事吧？

125
00:08:44,320 --> 00:08:46,510
We should probably get going soon.
我們得趕快走了

126
00:08:46,820 --> 00:08:49,350
But the party's just getting started.
但是派對才剛開始

127
00:08:49,560 --> 00:08:53,550
We have to be at The Four Seasons for drinks in 15 minutes.
我們得在15分鐘內 趕去四季餐廳喝酒

128
00:08:53,760 --> 00:08:55,590
Then The Plaza for dinner.
然後去廣場飯店吃晚飯

129
00:08:55,830 --> 00:08:58,420
So why did you plan a party at the same time?
那你為什麼還辦派對？

130
00:08:59,839 --> 00:09:01,830
不是的

131
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:07,300
Actually,American surprise parties are very short.
其實美國的驚喜派對都很短

132
00:09:07,540 --> 00:09:12,000
It's usually,"Surprise!" Then,"My God,I'm so surprised. Bye!"
通常都「驚喜！」 然後就「我好驚喜喔！再見」

133
00:09:14,180 --> 00:09:16,340
Ross,I'm having such a great time.
但是我覺得好好玩

134
00:09:16,550 --> 00:09:20,540
Your sister told me that you used to dress up like old ladies...
你妹說你以前會扮成老太太 

135
00:09:20,820 --> 00:09:23,260
...and host make-believe tea parties.
舉辦假的茶會

136
00:09:26,260 --> 00:09:28,730
Monica said that,did she?
摩妮卡說的是吧？

137
00:09:29,360 --> 00:09:32,230
Did she tell you that when she was little...
她有沒有說她小的時候

138
00:09:32,400 --> 00:09:35,130
...she was partially responsible for new legislation...
遊樂器材商增加鞦韆的載重量 

139
00:09:35,300 --> 00:09:39,430
...regulating the strength of swing sets?
她也是原因之一？

140
00:09:45,310 --> 00:09:48,540
Then what are you going to put on top of that?
你接下來要放什麼？

141
00:09:48,820 --> 00:09:52,250
-A little salami. -Oh,yeah.
一點蒜味肉腸 贊

142
00:09:53,550 --> 00:09:55,720
What goes on top of the salami?
蒜味肉腸上面呢？

143
00:09:56,190 --> 00:09:57,180
Pastrami.
熏牛肉 太讚了

144
00:10:01,160 --> 00:10:03,150
You're a genius.
你真是天才

145
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:07,660
Give me a hand with the zipper.
幫我拉一下拉鏈

146
00:10:10,440 --> 00:10:11,670
Up!
往上拉

147
00:10:14,740 --> 00:10:18,270
-You changed? -I decided I needed my lucky dress.
你換衣服？ 對，我需要我的幸運裙

148
00:10:18,550 --> 00:10:21,110
-Lucky means more cleavage? -lt does for me.
幸運是指露更多乳溝？ 我覺得是

149
00:10:32,830 --> 00:10:34,520
Look at him! He's so cute.
你們看他多帥 

150
00:10:34,830 --> 00:10:37,660
I just want to grab him and kiss him.
真想一把捉過來親下去

151
00:10:37,900 --> 00:10:40,560
How could I kiss him without him knowing I like him?
但是他不知道我喜歡他

152
00:10:40,840 --> 00:10:43,770
I know how you can get him. Take off your bra.
有個辦法-脫胸罩

153
00:10:44,710 --> 00:10:45,690
What?
什麼？

154
00:10:45,910 --> 00:10:47,870
-This scene in Footloose -Flashdance.
在「渾身是勁」裡… 是「閃舞」

155
00:10:49,210 --> 00:10:51,610
-Yeah. With that plumber girl? -A welder.
對…那個水電女工 是焊接工

156
00:10:54,180 --> 00:10:55,940
Were you,like,in the movie?
你是有演嗎？

157
00:10:58,350 --> 00:11:03,090
She takes off her bra under the shirt and pulls it out the sleeve.
總之她在衣服底下脫掉胸罩 從袖子抽出來

158
00:11:03,290 --> 00:11:06,050
Very sexy. And classy.
非常性感，而且有格調

159
00:11:09,800 --> 00:11:13,600
-Or you could use mistletoe. -It's not Christmas.
不然你也可以用檞寄生 又不是聖誕節

160
00:11:13,830 --> 00:11:15,630
-Spin-the-bottle. -He's not 11.
轉瓶子 他不是小孩子

161
00:11:19,570 --> 00:11:22,470
Thank you so much for this. It was so thoughtful of you.
謝謝你們，你們真用心

162
00:11:22,780 --> 00:11:23,940
You're leaving?
你們要走了？

163
00:11:24,210 --> 00:11:27,940
-We have something we have to get to. -I'm gonna take off too.
對，我們還有事 我也要走了

164
00:11:28,150 --> 00:11:30,950
You can't leave yet. You have to stay.
先別走，留下來 

165
00:11:31,220 --> 00:11:33,810
We've got the whole big thing planned.
我們準備了重頭戲

166
00:11:34,460 --> 00:11:35,550
What big thing?
什麼重頭戲？

167
00:11:35,790 --> 00:11:39,450
Spin-the-bottle works like this: I spin the bottle.
轉瓶子的規則是，我轉瓶子

168
00:11:39,660 --> 00:11:42,460
Lands on Gunther, so I would have to kiss Gunther.
指向阿甘，我就要親阿甘

169
00:11:43,960 --> 00:11:45,630
All right.
就這樣

170
00:11:46,730 --> 00:11:48,290
Who wants to go first?
誰要先？ 

171
00:11:48,500 --> 00:11:49,730
I'll go.
我先

172
00:11:55,010 --> 00:11:56,570
Welcome to America.
歡迎來到美國

173
00:12:03,780 --> 00:12:05,340
Oh,my God!
天哪

174
00:12:06,490 --> 00:12:09,180
Two in a row! You gotta use your tongues now.
連續兩次！來個舌吻吧

175
00:12:14,930 --> 00:12:16,290
All right.
再來

176
00:12:18,170 --> 00:12:19,860
What are the odds?
太巧了

177
00:12:21,840 --> 00:12:23,360
That's enough!
夠了

178
00:12:25,010 --> 00:12:27,530
Let's let someone else play.
讓別人玩吧

179
00:12:28,880 --> 00:12:31,710
If you didn't want to play, then why'd you come to the party?
你不想玩幹嘛來？

180
00:12:33,780 --> 00:12:35,270
All right,I'll go.
我來好了

181
00:12:36,320 --> 00:12:40,120
Somebody loose. Somebody loose.
豪放女！豪放女

182
00:12:43,520 --> 00:12:45,750
Story of my life.
我的人生寫照

183
00:12:46,532 --> 00:12:47,726
再轉一次

184
00:12:51,070 --> 00:12:53,630
Story of my father's life.
我爸的人生寫照

185
00:12:53,800 --> 00:12:55,830
Okay,my turn.
該我

186
00:12:59,370 --> 00:13:00,430
Look at that!
是你！

187
00:13:00,780 --> 00:13:02,000
Oh,my God.
天哪

188
00:13:06,150 --> 00:13:07,510
The baby just kicked!
天哪，寶寶踢了

189
00:13:08,620 --> 00:13:11,710
It's okay. It's okay. If it kicked once,it'll kick again!
他會再踢的

190
00:13:15,620 --> 00:13:19,680
Everybody just remember where they were sitting.
大家要記住剛才的位置

191
00:13:29,240 --> 00:13:30,830
It was a bug.
有蟲

192
00:13:34,840 --> 00:13:36,610
It doesn't matter how much I'm craving it.
不管我多想吃 

193
00:13:36,880 --> 00:13:40,210
You know why I'm never gonna eat meat? Because it's cold-blooded murder.
我絕不吃肉，那是冷血謀殺

194
00:13:41,180 --> 00:13:42,980
Okay.
好

195
00:13:47,860 --> 00:13:50,190
There's a Phoebe on my sandwich!
我的三明治上有菲比

196
00:13:52,160 --> 00:13:53,490
What are you doing?
菲比，你幹什麼？ 

197
00:13:53,760 --> 00:13:55,820
I can't help it!
我沒辦法

198
00:13:56,200 --> 00:13:59,030
I need the meat! The baby needs the meat.
我要吃肉，寶寶要吃肉

199
00:13:59,330 --> 00:14:01,030
You know when you're dating someone...
跟別人交往...

200
00:14:01,200 --> 00:14:04,230
...and you don't want to cheat unless it's with someone really hot?
...要專一 除非第三者真的很辣

201
00:14:07,410 --> 00:14:08,400
Totally.
那當然 

202
00:14:08,640 --> 00:14:11,810
This is the same kind of deal.
這就對了

204
00:14:12,050 --> 00:14:14,240
If you're gonna do something wrong...
吃肉也一樣，要錯…

205
00:14:16,450 --> 00:14:17,440
...do it right.
就要錯得漂亮

206
00:14:20,750 --> 00:14:23,750
-I'll be back in a minute. -Okay.
我馬上回來 好

207
00:14:24,230 --> 00:14:26,590
What are you doing to me?
你想怎樣？

209
00:14:27,090 --> 00:14:30,290
I'm trying to get Emily out of here, and you keep talking to her...
我想把她帶走 你卻一直跟她講話 

210
00:14:30,460 --> 00:14:33,090
...being all interesting and making her laugh.
裝風趣又逗她笑

211
00:14:33,270 --> 00:14:35,530
I don't want you to be funny anymore.
從現在起，請你別那麼風趣

212
00:14:35,800 --> 00:14:39,670
Rachel wants me to be funny, you don't want me to be funny.
瑞秋要我風趣 你卻不要我風趣

213
00:14:39,840 --> 00:14:44,470
From now on,I'm gonna be funny sometimes,and not funny others.
從現在起，我要有時候風趣 有時候不風趣

214
00:14:52,490 --> 00:14:54,010
You feel better now?
感覺好多了嗎？ 

215
00:14:54,190 --> 00:14:56,210
Yeah,but at what cost?
對，但是代價呢？

216
00:14:57,260 --> 00:14:59,280
Six more months,three meals a day.
三餐吃肉吃半年？

217
00:14:59,490 --> 00:15:03,430
I am going to eat,like, you know,millions of cows.
我會吃掉 幾百萬頭牛

219
00:15:04,370 --> 00:15:06,860
Mommy cows,daddy cows,baby cows
牛爸爸，牛媽媽，牛寶寶

220
00:15:07,030 --> 00:15:11,200
No. No,I will never eat baby cows. No veal!
我絕不吃牛寶寶，死也不吃

221
00:15:11,370 --> 00:15:13,570
Oh,but veal.
盡量不吃

222
00:15:15,280 --> 00:15:18,140
What if I even things out for you,meat-wise?
要是我幫你平衡過來呢？ 什麼？

223
00:15:18,410 --> 00:15:21,140
-What? -I eat a lot of meat,right?
我很會吃肉對吧？ 對

224
00:15:21,350 --> 00:15:24,880
But suppose,until the baby's born, I laid off it.
要是在寶寶出生前，我戒吃肉

225
00:15:25,150 --> 00:15:28,550
No extra animals would die. You'd be eating my animals.
就不會多死動物 你是在吃我的份

226
00:15:30,020 --> 00:15:32,050
I can't believe you'd do that for me.
你居然願意為我這麼做

227
00:15:32,360 --> 00:15:36,090
Absolutely. I could be a vegetarian.
當然願意，我也可以吃素

228
00:15:36,430 --> 00:15:38,920
There's no meat in beer,right?
啤酒裡沒有肉吧？

229
00:15:39,530 --> 00:15:43,700
We can still make dinner if we skip the appetizers and ask for our check right away.
不吃開胃菜，馬上買單 還趕得上吃主菜

230
00:15:48,280 --> 00:15:51,640
We can't go now. Rachel is going to put on a skit.
現在不能走，瑞秋要表演

231
00:15:53,750 --> 00:15:56,480
Oh,my God! Have you lost your mind?
我的天哪，你瘋了嗎？

232
00:15:57,150 --> 00:15:59,920
I am finally thinking clearly.
不，我終於想通了

233
00:16:01,660 --> 00:16:03,750
My lucky dress wasn't working out too well for me.
我的幸運裙效果不佳

234
00:16:03,960 --> 00:16:07,420
But for four years, this baby never missed.
但這一套整整4年都百發百中

235
00:16:08,060 --> 00:16:10,620
Wait,I can't let
瑞秋，我不能讓你…

236
00:16:10,900 --> 00:16:13,160
Actually,I want to see what happens.
我也想看熱鬧

237
00:16:17,000 --> 00:16:18,770
Nice costume.
好棒的行頭

238
00:16:20,510 --> 00:16:24,770
Well,I wanted to give Emily a big American goodbye cheer.
是啊，我想給艾蜜莉 來個美式的再見歡呼

239
00:16:30,350 --> 00:16:32,550
Ready. Okay.
預備…起

240
00:16:32,750 --> 00:16:34,480
Give me an "E"!
給我一個E E

241
00:16:34,660 --> 00:16:36,210
Give me an "M"!
給我一個M M

242
00:16:36,490 --> 00:16:37,920
Give me an "I"!
給我一個I I

243
00:16:38,130 --> 00:16:39,320
Give me an "L"!
給我一個L L

244
00:16:39,490 --> 00:16:40,480
Give me a "Y"!
給我一個Y Y

245
00:16:41,300 --> 00:16:43,560
What do you get?
加起來是什麼？

246
00:16:44,230 --> 00:16:48,100
Emily! Emily!
艾蜜莉！艾蜜莉…

247
00:16:51,970 --> 00:16:54,000
That's me as a cheerleader!
以上就是我的歡呼

248
00:16:56,480 --> 00:16:59,810
I loosened a tooth. It's no big deal. I have a dentist.
有一顆牙齒鬆了 小意思，我有牙醫

250
00:17:00,080 --> 00:17:02,510
I'll put some ice on it. Excuse me.
我去冰敷，失陪

251
00:17:04,920 --> 00:17:07,510
-What do I do now? -I think you're done.
怎麼辦怎麼辦？ 你應該是毀了

252
00:17:09,490 --> 00:17:11,460
Time to take off the bra.
該脫胸罩了

253
00:17:15,100 --> 00:17:17,760
That was really great.
剛才的表演很精彩 

254
00:17:18,600 --> 00:17:20,530
But I gotta take off.
但是我得走了

255
00:17:20,800 --> 00:17:23,830
Take the bra off.
脫~胸~罩

256
00:17:27,340 --> 00:17:28,930
Let's go get your coat.
我陪你去拿外套

257
00:17:32,380 --> 00:17:34,010
Rachel's my girlfriend.
瑞秋是我的女朋友

258
00:17:37,350 --> 00:17:39,880
So this was really fun.
今晚蠻開心的

259
00:17:40,150 --> 00:17:41,880
Yeah,it was real fun.
是啊，很開心

260
00:17:47,030 --> 00:17:48,890
You know,this bra...
這件胸罩…

261
00:17:51,530 --> 00:17:54,020
...is really bothering me.
實在很不舒服

262
00:17:55,500 --> 00:17:57,130
This used to be my bedroom.
這裡以前是我的房間

263
00:17:59,010 --> 00:18:03,200
A lot of memories in here. Lot of memories.
有很多回憶，很多很多回憶

264
00:18:03,810 --> 00:18:05,870
If these walls could talk, they'd say:
要是牆壁會說話，它們會說 

265
00:18:06,080 --> 00:18:08,210
"Want to hear some memories?"
「想聽聽往事嗎？」

266
00:18:14,760 --> 00:18:16,190
Need a hand?
你需要幫忙嗎？ 

267
00:18:16,420 --> 00:18:18,360
I got this all under control.
不用，沒問題

268
00:18:20,460 --> 00:18:22,990
You really don't seem like you do.
可是看起來不像

269
00:18:27,730 --> 00:18:30,230
God! Forget it!
算了啦！真是…

270
00:18:34,640 --> 00:18:37,670
This is not how this was supposed to happen.
事情不該是這樣的 

271
00:18:37,910 --> 00:18:39,240
What was supposed to happen?
不然應該怎樣？

272
00:18:41,350 --> 00:18:43,250
Can you not look at me when I say this?
你能不能不要看我？

273
00:18:47,590 --> 00:18:51,050
I thought that if I could get you here...
我以為要是能把你找來

274
00:18:52,130 --> 00:18:54,920
...I could seduce you.
我就可以色誘你

275
00:18:56,930 --> 00:19:00,390
-Excuse me? -Seduce you.
什麼？ 引誘你

277
00:19:09,140 --> 00:19:12,540
I don't wear suits to work.
我上班不穿西裝 

278
00:19:12,750 --> 00:19:15,210
And I bought six of them from you.
卻跟你買了六套

279
00:19:16,220 --> 00:19:19,150
I'm sorry. I thought you needed them.
抱歉喔，我以為你有需要

280
00:19:20,720 --> 00:19:24,750
My point is,I kept coming back because I wanted to see you.
我一直去找你，因為我想見你

281
00:19:25,530 --> 00:19:28,020
-Why? -Because I like you.
為什麼？ 因為我喜歡你

282
00:19:29,000 --> 00:19:30,690
You like me?
你喜歡我？

283
00:19:32,430 --> 00:19:37,170
I mean,you're beautiful and smart and sophisticated.
是啊，你漂亮、聰明又成熟

284
00:19:37,440 --> 00:19:40,870
A lot of this isn't based on tonight.
這些印象不是來自今晚

285
00:19:42,340 --> 00:19:43,830
But you like me?
但是你喜歡我？

286
00:19:44,180 --> 00:19:48,710
I can't believe this. All this time, I liked you and you liked me!
這段日子以來 我們竟然一直互相喜歡

287
00:19:50,480 --> 00:19:52,110
-But -No "but."
但是… 不要說「但是」

288
00:19:52,350 --> 00:19:56,810
"But" is never good. Let's leave it at "l like you and you like me."
「但是」都沒好事 停在「我們互相喜歡」就好

289
00:19:58,090 --> 00:20:02,050
-Okay. However -No,that's a fancy "but."
好，然而… 那是好聽的「但是」

290
00:20:04,460 --> 00:20:08,530
My marriage,like,just ended.
我剛結束我的婚姻

291
00:20:08,800 --> 00:20:13,030
And I'm really not ready to get into anything yet.
我還沒心情跟別人交往

292
00:20:14,580 --> 00:20:16,570
But....
但是…？

293
00:20:18,080 --> 00:20:21,280
I'm sorry. I just need a little time.
對不起，我需要一點時間

294
00:20:25,490 --> 00:20:27,280
Okay.

295
00:20:30,660 --> 00:20:33,420
There you are. I was looking for you.
你在這裡，我在找你

296
00:20:33,860 --> 00:20:36,890
Joshua's gone, so you and Emily are free to go.
約書亞走了 你和艾蜜莉可以走了

297
00:20:37,260 --> 00:20:38,530
It's okay.
無所謂 

298
00:20:39,230 --> 00:20:42,500
She's still in there enjoying her fake party.
她還在裡面享受這場假派對


299
00:20:43,400 --> 00:20:46,100
It's too late to do the stuff I had planned.
現在要做什麼也來不及了

300
00:20:48,610 --> 00:20:50,940
I'm sorry. I ruined your evening.
抱歉，我毀了你美好的夜晚

301
00:20:51,980 --> 00:20:53,040
Yeah.
是啊

302
00:20:54,780 --> 00:20:58,580
If it makes you feel any better, I made a fool of myself.
我出了個大醜 你有沒有高興一點？

303
00:21:00,520 --> 00:21:02,390
Helps a little.
有一點

304
00:21:03,560 --> 00:21:06,360
Is there room on that step for a pathetic loser?
有地方讓悲慘的失敗者坐嗎？ 

305
00:21:06,560 --> 00:21:08,360
Have a seat.
坐吧

306
00:21:15,040 --> 00:21:18,270
-I'm so sorry. -It's okay.
對不起 沒關係 

307
00:21:18,470 --> 00:21:21,440
It was just a two-week thing anyway.
反正只是一段2星期的戀情

308
00:21:21,640 --> 00:21:24,040
I just didn't want it to end this way.
我只是不想這樣結束 

309
00:21:24,280 --> 00:21:26,710
Or maybe you didn't want it to end.
也許你不想結束呢？

310
00:21:27,710 --> 00:21:29,380
What do you mean?
什麼意思？

311
00:21:29,580 --> 00:21:31,810
You seem to really like her.
你似乎真的很喜歡她

312
00:21:34,350 --> 00:21:36,020
I really do.
沒錯

313
00:21:37,890 --> 00:21:42,020
But what am I going to do? We agreed it'd be a two-week thing.
但我能怎麼辦？ 我們說好只在一起2星期

314
00:21:42,230 --> 00:21:44,090
No commitment.
不要有承諾

315
00:21:46,171 --> 00:21:47,468
羅斯

316
00:21:48,500 --> 00:21:53,170
That girl just spent the entire evening talking to your friends...
那個女孩整晚都跟你的朋友 

317
00:21:53,440 --> 00:21:55,840
...asking to hear stories about you...
吵著要聽你的事

318
00:21:56,040 --> 00:21:58,670
...Iooking through Monica's photo albums.
還拿摩妮卡的相簿來看

319
00:21:58,910 --> 00:22:01,940
You don't do that if you're just in it for two weeks.
只想在一起2周才不會這麼做

320
00:22:02,750 --> 00:22:04,240
You think?
是嗎？

321
00:22:05,520 --> 00:22:10,180
You've got 14 hours until she has to be at the airport.
她還有14個小時才要去機場

322
00:22:10,390 --> 00:22:12,620
And you're sitting here in a hallway...
你卻坐在走廊上

323
00:22:12,890 --> 00:22:16,090
...with a 28-year-old cheerleader with a fat lip.
陪一個28歲 嘴腫起來的啦啦隊長

324
00:22:19,700 --> 00:22:21,260
You're right.
你說得對

325
00:22:26,840 --> 00:22:28,600
Thanks.
謝了

326
00:22:32,810 --> 00:22:34,610
What photo album was it?
哪一本相簿？ 

327
00:22:35,550 --> 00:22:38,180
I don't know. It was you and a bunch of albino kids.
不知道 你跟一堆白子小孩的合照

328
00:22:41,560 --> 00:22:44,050
Oh,my God! Those weren't albino kids.
他們不是白子 

329
00:22:44,290 --> 00:22:46,280
That was computer camp!
那是電腦夏令營啦

330
00:22:52,300 --> 00:22:55,960
-You're a pathetic loser,right? -Oh,yeah.
你是悲慘的失敗者吧？ 就是我

331
00:22:56,640 --> 00:22:57,860
Sit!
坐

332
00:23:04,180 --> 00:23:05,410
Hi.

333
00:23:05,710 --> 00:23:08,010
Oh,my God. Joshua.
天哪，約書亞

334
00:23:08,750 --> 00:23:10,380
Look...
聽著...

335
00:23:10,680 --> 00:23:13,590
...all those things I said about not being ready
...我剛才說我沒心情…

336
00:23:13,850 --> 00:23:16,320
-They're not true? -They're all true.
不是真的？ 不，都是真的

337
00:23:19,160 --> 00:23:21,060
But....
但是…

338
00:23:23,700 --> 00:23:25,060
I love that "but."
我喜歡這個「但是」

339
00:23:35,580 --> 00:23:38,480
Do you want to go inside and get some coffee?
要不要進去喝杯咖啡？ 

340
00:23:38,750 --> 00:23:40,610
Okay.
好

341
00:23:47,090 --> 00:23:49,250
Every time.
百發百中

342
00:23:53,590 --> 00:23:56,260
-What do you got there? -Pastrami.
你放什麼？ 熏牛肉

343
00:23:56,701 --> 00:23:58,293
贊

344
00:23:59,770 --> 00:24:02,390
-You know what goes good with that? -Corned beef.
你知道什麼跟它最配？ 醃牛肉

345
00:24:04,270 --> 00:24:07,300
I was going to say bologna. But that's better.
我想說紅腸，但醃牛肉更棒

346
00:24:08,480 --> 00:24:11,340
-How about that smoked turkey? -Okay.
要不要放點熏火雞肉？ 好

347
00:24:13,150 --> 00:24:14,440
Oh,mama!
媽呀

348
00:24:16,080 --> 00:24:18,570
-When is the baby due? -Six months.
寶寶什麼時候生？ 半年後

349
00:24:20,120 --> 00:24:24,450
If a cow died of natural causes, I could have one of those,right?
自然死亡的牛可以吃吧？

350
00:24:24,860 --> 00:24:26,880
Not if I get there first.
我會先下手

351
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


352
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000

